 I've racked my brain and just can't come up with anything to describe how this gap interacts with the variables. CAD has been no help, either. I'd really appreciate it if someone could help me out with this. 

Answer: HINT 
 You are almost there! Notice that  $S = \text{span}\{(1,-1,0,0),(0,0,1,-1)\}$ . 
 Considering that we are dealing with the standard inner product in  $\mathbb{R}^{4}$ ,  $v = (a,b,c,d)\in S^{\perp}$  iff
 \begin{align*}
\begin{cases}
\langle v,(1,-1,0,0)\rangle = 0\\\\
\langle v,(0,0,1,-1)\rangle = 0
\end{cases}
\end{align*} 
